    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d327-a1">

                <pb facs="0527" n="457" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg457"/>

                <head>Baron Magnus to Mr. Otterbourg</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">City of Mexico,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-09-18"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 18, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister:</hi> The King, my august sovereign,
                    having been pleased to recall me from my place as minister resident in Mexico, I
                    am ordered to place the subjects of the North German Confederation under the
                    protection of the representative of the United States at this capital.</p>
                <p>As I start for Vera Cruz immediately, I beg you will take my countrymen of North
                    Germany, now in Mexico, under the protection of the government of the United
                    States, so worthily represented by your excellency.</p>
                <p>Accept the assurances of my most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>A. DE MAGNUS.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marcus Otterbourg,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
